      "md": "# 🎉 Welcome to Pagezest!\n\n-----\n\n**Published:** May 2, 2025\n\n**Author:** Pagezest\n\n**Category:** Getting Started\n\n---\n[[posts]]\n[[/posts]]\n\n----\n\n[[toc]]\n[[/toc]]\n-----\n\nWelcome to **Pagezest**. With this CMS, you can create, organize, and share your content quickly and efficiently.\n\n## 📌 Key Features\n\n- ✅ Markdown editor\n- 📂 Flexible content categorization\n- 🔒 Role-based user permissions\n- 🌐 SEO-friendly URLs\n\n---\n\n## 🧭 Navigation Overview\n\nUse the sidebar to explore:\n\n1. **Dashboard** \n– See recent activity\n2. **Posts** – Create and manage content\n4. **Settings** – Customize your CMS\n\n---\n\n## ✍ Markdown Examples\n\nHere are a few elements you can use in your posts:\n\n### Blockquote\n\n> “Content is king, but engagement is queen.” – Anonymous\n\n### Code Block\n\n```javascript\nfunction greet(name) {\n  return `Hello, ${name}!`;\n}\n```\n\n### Table\n\n| Feature      | Available | Notes                 |\n|--------------|-----------|------------------------|\n| Blog Posts   | ✅        | Create & publish posts |\n| Image Upload | ✅        | Drag & drop support    |\n| Dark Mode    | 🔜        | Coming soon!           |\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Next Steps\n\n- [x] Create your first post\n- [ ] Add a category\n- [ ] Upload a cover image\n- [ ] Invite a teammate\n\n---\n\n## 📞 Need Help?\n\nVisit the [Help Center](https://pagezest.com/help) or email **support@pagezest.com**.\n\n---\n"
    },
    "created_at": ".",
    "updated_at": "."
